# Negative control for "when this creature dies": Swords to Plowshares exiles the Shaper, which is not dying (CR 700.4:
# only a put into a graveyard from the battlefield), so Bot1 draws nothing: its hand stays at 3 (Bot1 gets Swords' life
# gain: 20 + 2 = 22). Bot1 declines the enters search.

[Bot1 Deck]
Forest
Mox Emerald
Mox Ruby
Simulacrum Shaper
Island x3
Plains
Island x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Swords to Plowshares
Island x14

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Simulacrum Shaper.Cast
Bot1.Decline
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot2.Pass
